<mxCell id="t3c47" value="&lt;b&gt;Cost = depth of the path.&lt;/b&gt; Each comparison drops one level, so search and insert are O(h): O(log N) when balanced, O(N) when the tree is a chain.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Insert takes the same path and hangs the new node at the first empty slot it reaches." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="350" width="390" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
